.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/81/Valle_Trebbia-%28scaled-and-sharpened%29.jpg/500px-Valle_Trebbia-%28scaled-and-sharpened%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Apennine Mountains and Trebbia river, Italy","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AValle_Trebbia-(scaled-and-sharpened).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7f/Ural_mountains_3_448122223_93fa978a6d_b.jpg/500px-Ural_mountains_3_448122223_93fa978a6d_b.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7f/Ural_mountains_3_448122223_93fa978a6d_b.jpg/500px-Ural_mountains_3_448122223_93fa978a6d_b.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The northern Urals at high latitude and elevation have an alpine climate and barren ground.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AUral_mountains_3_448122223_93fa978a6d_b.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/39/GlarusAlps.jpg/500px-GlarusAlps.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/39/GlarusAlps.jpg/500px-GlarusAlps.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"An alpine mire in the Swiss Alps","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGlarusAlps.jpg"}],"sounds":{"mountain":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e2/En-uk-mountain.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e2/En-uk-mountain.ogg/En-uk-mountain.ogg.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/ca